/difftest
/recorddiff
/sworn-milter
/genvectors

# `go build -o bin/ ./cmd/...` output. Not `/sworn`: that pattern also
# matches the sworn/ package directory, and silently kept a new source file
# out of every commit.
/bin/
# Where `go build -o sworn ./cmd/sworn` puts the binary: inside the package
# directory, since sworn/ already exists.
/sworn/sworn

# Signing keys written by `sworn keygen` when run from the repository root.
*.key

# Local agent tooling state. Never belongs in a public repository.
.omc/
